Negatives - 13.</physdesc><container altrender="19 x 15 Oversize Document Box (Tall)" id="ea3df01a46837618200f649b6e76c7ad" label="Still Image [A0000000076219]" type="box">61</container><container altrender="20 x 16 Oversize Document Box (Tall)" id="7b4e0201196c2e56e2fa39d0088908ce" label="Still Image [A0000000076220]" type="box">62</container></did><scopecontent id="f9af74ef899540705f88c29dfe53e1d9"><head>Scope and Contents note</head><p>boats, group portraits, Harkness family, Houses, weddings, children</p></scopecontent></c><c id="1b6f96d8bcc84fdfb1a0757bcd60da91" level="file"><did><unittitle>Harkness Family - Houses</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/256505</unitid><unitdate calendar="gregorian" datechar="creation" era="ce">undated</unitdate><physdesc id="516018b50ae1817e9e55fa9305f92f31">Oversized Prints - 2</physdesc><container altrender="20 x 16 Oversize Document Box (Tall)" id="f5d6bf1a1662ce919c97022a21e461f9" label="Still Image [A0000000076220]" type="box">62</container></did><scopecontent id="b10ff9ccf231ddf96f13014a634fd0f9"><head>Scope and Contents note</head><p>Commonwealth Fund buildings, Houses, Architectural details</p></scopecontent></c><c id="4ab334a559d7d99a2b31a97719e968ed" level="file"><did><unittitle>Edward Stephen Harkness Portrait</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982367</unitid><materialspec id="df6d1cb7131e86d6aa89f34f14c3e966">1 portrait, approximately 200 copies.</materialspec><container altrender="11 x 9 Photo Box" id="234c3c052ee1dd033d7e75354917a518" label="Still Image [A0000000076200]" type="box">69</container></did></c><c id="adc7a0f0576cb919c142a42699a6f917" level="file"><did><unittitle>Portraits used in Annual Reports</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982368</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1927/1941" type="inclusive">1927-1941</unitdate><materialspec id="f1f41083994f1d80db4e66b11c97ee6a">43 prints. Prints were attached to pages through adhesives and fasteners that have inflicted minor damage to both fronts and backs of photos. Photo credits on backs of most images. Separate pages have captions identifying the individual in the photograph and the annual report in which the photograph was used.</materialspec><container altrender="12.5 x 10.5 Photo Box" id="c6d518c06013802def7cb85eb2b1905e" label="mixed materials [A0000000076201]" type="box">70</container></did><scopecontent id="93aa1db32bb8d84e6ce3c17e3d73b436"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>Photographs of individuals used in various annual reports between 1924 and 1941.</p></scopecontent></c><c id="0c93c0167ee6d6f66880d5859f170eb9" level="file"><did><unittitle>Early Harkness Fellows group photographs</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982369</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1933/1937" type="inclusive">1933-1937</unitdate><physdesc id="9813ef6875c41b4bd0d26b8140719d9e">4 prints mounted on boards. Captions on backs.</physdesc><container altrender="15 x 12 Photo Box (Short)" id="26cd72d27b88e649c624a5c845dc5017" label="Still Image [A0000000076202]" type="box">71</container></did><scopecontent id="8092dd16938b60f1bf93a74436370f1d"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>Group photographs of Harkness Fellows (Commonwealth Fund Fellowships) from 1933 to 1937. Captions on backs identify the people in the photographs.</p></scopecontent></c><c id="e01cf6f57cc1539729a2f37fc389a441" level="file"><did><unittitle>House at 35 Portman Square, London, England</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982370</unitid><unitdate certainty="approximate" datechar="creation" normal="1932/1932">circa 1932</unitdate><physdesc id="7822c100705270e227650fe5661f63b4">7 still images: 7 photograph prints, including 1 mounted print. Captions on backs of images. Some damage to the plaster of the mounted image.</physdesc><container altrender="15 x 12 Photo Box (Short)" id="cd5562cd2b673d125d8165a4aedea773" label="Still Image [A0000000076202]" type="box">71</container></did><scopecontent id="33f3dc9e8db6aaebe0442ebff7955390"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>Photographs show the interior and exterior of the house at 35 Portman Square, London, England. A few photos show people who are identified by the captions on the backs of the photos.</p></scopecontent></c><c id="45bb5b85750329e39475c44cb0d5b6e2" level="file"><did><unittitle>Christmas parties photographs</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982371</unitid><unitdate certainty="approximate" datechar="creation" normal="1951/1953" type="inclusive">circa 1951-1953</unitdate><physdesc id="468b5de8fcb2f30ca2e28ff36078752f">31 photograph prints. Some images have captions on their backs.</physdesc><container altrender="15 x 12 Photo Box (Short)" id="7f2030fd1fb697607bc59757312613be" label="Still Image [A0000000076202]" type="box">71</container></did><scopecontent id="1bee54e7440075b1229eed33249638ad"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>There are appear to be at least 2 different Christmas parties documented in the photographs. Captions on the backs of the photos identify these 2 parties as taking place in 1951 and 1953. Photographs are mainly of children at Santa Claus presentations.</p></scopecontent></c><c id="ce0d9c1c077c71ea61b723c7df0e52e6" level="file"><did><unittitle>May 2 1951 wedding snapshots</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/1295904</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1951/1951">1951</unitdate><physdesc id="cf725b14abb45288bb26aba8002d2f70">4 snapshots. Some description on back of images.</physdesc><container altrender="15 x 12 Photo Box (Short)" id="2b7383335d784ec364dd73bba4bf45b0" label="Still Image [A0000000076202]" type="box">71</container></did><scopecontent id="79434f9d1fa189a760c0b7c5b03b6667"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>Snapshots are of guests to a wedding in New York City on May 2, 1951. Partial description on the backs of the images may help users identify the people in the photographs.</p></scopecontent><processinfo id="e833abbce33943c28eece39d1e80bcd2"><head>Processing Information</head><p>The images were previously not inventoried.</p></processinfo></c><c id="816e171e92caf2c5da35daedc2712868" level="file"><did><unittitle>38 Upper Brook Street, London, England group photograph</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/1295905</unitid><unitdate calendar="gregorian" datechar="creation" era="ce">undated</unitdate><physdesc id="38b5558103b71ec084a3b4ee6883ede5">1 color group photograph. Caption on back of image.</physdesc><container altrender="15 x 12 Photo Box (Short)" id="d90c29479aa3bc52badadec8507a90ad" label="Still Image [A0000000076202]" type="box">71</container></did><scopecontent id="2f5bb9e1a7a725d264c4ee346ec07553"><head>Scope and Contents</head><p>Photograph shows a group of men standing in a house at 38 Upper Brook Street, London, England. The men can be identified from the caption on the back of the photograph.</p></scopecontent><processinfo id="26a72ec1d7b45998d0489af68c7135ea"><head>Processing Information</head><p>Photograph was not previously inventoried.</p></processinfo></c><c id="fd9890d3ccc099560b2b32837a6cf9cd" level="file"><did><unittitle>1 East 57th Street, New York City - First Office of the Commonwealth Fund</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982373</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1919/1925" type="inclusive">1919-1925</unitdate><materialspec id="ca680fc08f53896772a568b0dbdc6acc">1 print</materialspec><container altrender="17.5 x 12 Oversize Document Box" id="33183b4c00192086357e1be40bdd0aeb" label="Still Image [A0000000076203]" type="box">72</container></did></c><c id="c0d3731e28fcac178806c2d6bd3e6ea9" level="file"><did><unittitle>Harkness House - 1 East 75th Street, New York City</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982374</unitid><materialspec id="baba7647814111e0d7e22feb9fd1bc16">13 prints, including framed print</materialspec><container altrender="17.5 x 12 Oversize Document Box" id="18733c7cca05010b968c2b6f59050bb5" label="Still Image [A0000000076203]" type="box">72</container></did></c><c id="8fbc11d9a1296a07a3abac07e1d7df29" level="file"><did><unittitle>Harkness House - Color Slides of Interior, taken by Jon G. Fox</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982375</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1978/1978">1978</unitdate><materialspec id="fa714d54a6e2f8f2e4095e3b3d48aae6">Approximately 40 slides</materialspec><container altrender="17.5 x 12 Oversize Document Box" id="d0a0a9dce4c7dfe621093fc89caccbbb" label="Still Image [A0000000076203]" type="box">72</container></did></c><c id="c18ad6d22a095bcf7be2b86c61de4ba2" level="file"><did><unittitle>Harkness House - Interiors</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982481</unitid><materialspec id="0c15fcf94cf6638ac8e478e5b1edf63b">13 prints</materialspec><container altrender="25 x 21 Oversize Document Box (Tall)" id="170c4c7952d347b2cd2a8f8c73769237" label="Still Image [A0000000076221]" type="box">63</container></did></c><c id="a1226343c395625e0e28df7dd1453a39" level="file"><did><unittitle>Staff Portraits</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/982376</unitid><materialspec id="23c07cbcd0f4defe6097c392f0e5dd6f">20 prints. Also includes negatives.</materialspec><container altrender="18 x 12 Oversize Document Box (Tall)" id="1fc7d5a8b570c4af4518c839322dbc6d" label="Still Image [A0000000076204]" type="box">73</container></did></c></c></dsc>
